 result of a hard lesson learned, not a tagline. Hover any pillar to see the proof.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 sm:gap-5"><div class="group relative rounded-3xl border p-9 overflow-hidden transition-colors col-span-12 lg:col-span-8" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><span class="text-[12px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase" style="color:#4ECDC4">01</span><span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full border" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);color:#cfcfcf">4 cities</span></div><h3 class="mt-10 text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-0.015em]" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Global Team</h3><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#cfcfcf">Senior engineers, designers, strategists and product leads across Lagos, London, Berlin and New York. Time-zone overlap with whoever you sell to.</p><span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500" class="lg-btn"></span></div><div class="group relative rounded-3xl border p-9 overflow-hidden transition-colors col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><span class="text-[12px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase" style="color:#4ECDC4">02</span><span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full border" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);color:#cfcfcf">Lagos HQ</span></div><h3 class="mt-10 text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-0.015em]" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Nigerian Market Expertise</h3><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#cfcfcf">Decade of building for Nigerian consumers, regulators and rails — Paystack, Flutterwave, NIBSS, CBN, NDPR, USSD, agency banking. We don&#x27;t learn on your dime.</p><span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500" class="lg-btn"></span></div><div class="group relative rounded-3xl border p-9 overflow-hidden transition-colors col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><span class="text-[12px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase" style="color:#4ECDC4">03</span><span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full border" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);color:#cfcfcf">Founders, not freelancers</span></div><h3 class="mt-10 text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-0.015em]" style="font-family:&#x27;Inter Tight&#x27;, sans-serif">Startup Experience</h3><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#cfcfcf">Our partners have founded, led and exited companies. We&#x27;ve sat in your seat — the board prep, the burn meetings, the term-sheet negotiations.</p><span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-500" class="lg-btn"></span></div><div class="group relative rounded-3xl border p-9 overflow-hidden transition-colors col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><span class="text-[12px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase" style="color:#4ECDC4">04</span><span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full border" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);color:#cfcfcf">Avg. relationship: 3.4 yrs</span></div><h3 class="mt-10 text-[28px] md:text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-0.015em]" st